# T5.4 case 7 on SQL Server: Esc the instant after Ctrl-R, with no wait
# between them. Whatever the driver had got to, the tab may not be left on
# `Running`, the cancel has to land, and the next statement has to run on the
# same tab — which means the driver opened a connection to replace the one it
# threw away.

key c
wait busy
expect ●

key Tab
type waitfor delay '00:00:10'
key Ctrl-R
key Esc
wait busy
expect cancelled after
expect-not Running
frame cancelled

key Ctrl-A
key Ctrl-K
type select 42 as answer
key Ctrl-R
wait busy
expect answer
expect 42
frame after-cancel
key Ctrl-Q
